            "I want to be very honest here, because this is the question I've asked myself most often in the dark. There were years when I felt hopeless and low: what if I never clear it, and I have no other skill? Some nights were heavy, and I didn't always have an answer for myself. I'm not writing this as someone who solved it. I'm still walking with this question.",
